cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this data or code, please cite the article below. This repository holds the
  rig database and tracking data for every animal in the study, the pipeline that derives
  the trial and session measures, the notebooks that generate the figures, and the
  supporting videos.
type: dataset
title: >-
  Data and analysis code for "Path Integration Promotes Flexible Navigational Decision
  Making"
